# DDCNB Project Rules

Read `AGENTS.md` first. For product UI work, also read:

- `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`
- `design-system/ddcnb-website/MASTER.md`
- `docs/agents/AGENT_DESIGN_CONTRACT.md`
- `docs/agents/MCP_USAGE.md`
- `docs/agents/AGENT_HANDOFF.md`

Use Lazyweb before product UI changes. Use Playwright for visual QA.

Use project primitives:

- Buttons: `components/ui/Button.tsx`
- Cards: `components/ui/GlassCard.tsx` or approved liquid/glass globals
- Icons: `components/ui/Icon.tsx`
- Tokens: `styles/tokens.css`

Do not introduce one-off colors, radii, shadows, fonts, card styles, button
styles, or animation systems. Keep first-party visuals in deep forest green,
gold, and neutral tones.

Before editing, declare the task scope. Do not edit files outside that scope.
